<title>USA: Interactive Flight names Alderfer CFO.</title>
<headline>Interactive Flight names Alderfer CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interactive Flight Technologies Inc said it has named John Alderfer as its new chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Alderfer replaces Bob Aten, who has recently left Interactive Flight, according to the company.</p>
<p>It said Alderfer has over 30 years experience in the financial and operational aspects of the gaming and service industries.  Most recently, he was senior vice president and CFO of Alliance Gaming Corp.</p>
</text>
